  "reason": "Only the RNA-only single-profile PCA baseline is known (acc 0.485, F1 0.464), so it is unclear whether image features are predictive at all. config_010 tests the minimal image-only counterpart using ResNet50 and singleprofile, isolating the modality/representation question without introducing aggregation or fusion. Establishing an image-only baseline is essential before spending budget on multimodal fusion or more complex multiprofile settings, because it clarifies whether image can contribute and provides a reference for later encoder and fusion comparisons."
